ypoint]]></name><cmt><![CDATA[Waypoint]]></cmt><desc><![CDATA[]]></desc><type>90</type></wpt><trk><name><![CDATA[Volcán Santa María Guatemala]]></name><cmt><![CDATA[Esta es la 4a montaña más alta de Guatemala, lamentablemente se encuentra repleta de basura 
Si quieres llegar a la cima sigue el sendero de basura. El desnivel es retador pero con paso constante se logra, comencé a las 2:30 am y toque cima a las 6:30 am. Requerí 2 litros de agua y snacks. Las vistas al Santiaguito son una locura]]></cmt><desc><![CDATA[Esta es la 4a montaña más alta de Guatemala, lamentablemente se encuentra repleta de basura 
Si quieres llegar a la cima sigue el sendero de basura. El desnivel es retador pero con paso constante se logra, comencé a las 2:30 am y toque cima a las 6:30 am. Requerí 2 litros de agua y snacks. Las vistas al Santiaguito son una locura]]></desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="14.787427" lon="-91.548599"><ele>2491.779</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:27:27Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787449" lon="-91.548643"><ele>2491.705</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:27:40Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787437" lon="-91.548598"><ele>2491.725</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:28:02Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787466" lon="-91.548637"><ele>2491.709</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:28:12Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.78742" lon="-91.548623"><ele>2491.749</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:28:22Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787374" lon="-91.548625"><ele>2491.751</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:28:26Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787414" lon="-91.548647"><ele>2491.786</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:28:51Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787367" lon="-91.548619"><ele>2491.799</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:29:27Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787318" lon="-91.548646"><ele>2491.786</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:29:33Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787362" lon="-91.548634"><ele>2491.719</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:29:44Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787406" lon="-91.548648"><ele>2491.742</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:29:54Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787409" lon="-91.548596"><ele>2491.763</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:30:30Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787378" lon="-91.548562"><ele>2491.739</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:31:56Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787337" lon="-91.54859"><ele>2491.754</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:32:15Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.78729" lon="-91.548566"><ele>2490.056</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:32:22Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.78724" lon="-91.548571"><ele>2488.411</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:32:28Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787188" lon="-91.54858"><ele>2488.409</ele><time>2026-02-03T08:32:35Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="14.787145" lon="-91.548593"><ele>2488